  "fscm": {
    "prefix": "FC",
    "title": "Financial Supply Chain Management",
    "title_de": "Finanzielles Supply Chain Management",
    "landscape": "Classic ECC credit management, FSCM Credit/Collections/Dispute Management, or S/4HANA successors; choose the exact path.",
    "risk": "Classic credit-control areas must be mapped to FSCM credit segments and business partners; the identifiers are not equivalent. Credit exposure is regenerated from integrated operational sources and must not also be posted as opening debt. Collections worklists and dispute amounts depend on the same FI receivable cohort. Status, promises, contacts, notes and attachments require approved business interfaces and access controls. Public Cloud collections and dispute automation is a distinct successor with its own ordered migration jobs, not an assumed on-premise adapter.",
    "risk_de": "Klassische Kreditkontrollbereiche auf FSCM-Kreditsegmente und Geschäftspartner abbilden. Kreditobligo wird aus operativen Quellen neu erzeugt und darf nicht zusätzlich als Anfangsschuld gebucht werden. Collections und Streitfälle auf dieselbe FI-Forderungspopulation beziehen. Status, Zusagen, Kontakte, Notizen und Anlagen benötigen freigegebene Schnittstellen und Berechtigungen. Collections and Dispute Automation in Public Cloud ist ein eigener Nachfolger mit geordneten Migrationsjobs.",
    "modules": [
      {
        "name": "credit_profile",
        "title": "Credit profiles and relationships",
        "structures": [
          {
            "stem": "CreditProfile",
            "keys": [
              "BusinessPartner"
